<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About Us | SkillsUSA</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Spectral:wght@400;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('header') %>
    <main>
      <section class="hero hero-about">
        <div class="hero-media" role="img" aria-label="About SkillsUSA"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>About Us</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">Learn who we are, what we do, and why we do it.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card-header">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card-content">
            <p>
              SkillsUSA is the #1 workforce development organization for students. We empower
              students to become skilled professionals, career-ready leaders and responsible
              community members. From our mission to our reach, from our brand to our history,
              learn who we are, what we do and why we do it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card-header">
            <h2>Become a Member</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card-content">
            <p>
              Whether you're a student or teacher interested in joining SkillsUSA or a
              potential industry partner ready to support us, learn the why's and how's here.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="card-link">Join SkillsUSA &#8594;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card-header">
            <h2>Officers, Partners and Advisors</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card-content">
            <p>
              From our officers to our dedicated association directors, from our board and
              partners to our committed staff, those who lead, operate, and support SkillsUSA are
              not only devoted to student success but also to self-success.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="card-link">Become a Sponsor &#8594;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
